ng. To request a return, please contact us at <a>sales@scale-o.com</a>. Refunds will be processed according to our refund policy.</p><p><strong>7. Warranty</strong></p><p>Our products come with a [insert number]-year warranty covering manufacturing defects. The warranty does not cover damage resulting from misuse, accidents, or unauthorized repairs.</p><p><strong>8. Intellectual Property</strong></p><p>All content on our website, including text, images, logos, and trademarks, is the property of Scale-O or its licensors and is protected by copyright and trademark laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or otherwise use any content from our website without our prior written permission.</p><p><strong>9. Limitation of Liability</strong></p><p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Scale-O shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or website. Our total liability for any claims arising from your use of our products or website shall not exceed the amount you paid for the product or service in question.</p><p><strong>10. Governing Law</strong></p><p>These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of [insert jurisdiction]. Any disputes arising from or related to these Terms and Conditions shall be resolved in the courts of [insert jurisdiction].</p><p><strong>11. Changes to Terms and Conditions</strong></p><p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. Any changes will be posted on our website, and your continued use of the website or purchase of products will constitute acceptance of the revised terms.</p><p><strong>12. Contact Us</strong></p><p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at:</p><ul><li><strong>Email:</strong> <a>sales@scale-o.com</a></li><li><strong>Contact Number:</strong> +91 9909963304</li></ul><p>Thank you for choosing Scale-O!</p>"
